{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Secret of Havendor&quot; is a story-driven fantasy RPG where you witness the making of a broken man. Step into the shoes of Mark, a young man who fled his home village, where he was despised all his life, for the mysterious city of Havendor. But no lesser trials await him there. Haunted by painful memories, he finds himself in a world where violence is the currency and trust is a luxury. Will Mark become a victim of his circumstances, or will he find the strength to change his destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Make difficult, irreversible choices at every turn. Will you walk the path of revenge and power, or choose mercy, risking everything?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Explore gloomy backstreets, ancient ruins, and dangerous forests. From taverns buzzing with rumors to cursed towers\u2014every corner of the world breathes mystery and danger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Battle creatures and dangerous foes by dodging their attacks (or get clobbered). Solve cunning puzzles on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The only thing sharper than your blade is the truth you're afraid to face.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Black, a monster hunter.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929160?t=1756709752","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3929160?t=1756709752","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929160/f85faacbcca02f52b057ef4f442d976f5301ffa4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756709752","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3929160/f85faacbcca02f52b057ef4f442d976f5301ffa4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756709752","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3931860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Secret of Havendor&quot; is a story-driven fantasy RPG where you witness the making of a broken man. Step into the shoes of Mark, a young man who fled his home village, where he was despised all his life, for the mysterious city of Havendor. But no lesser trials await him there. Haunted by painful memories, he finds himself in a world where violence is the currency and trust is a luxury. Will Mark become a victim of his circumstances, or will he find the strength to change his destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Make difficult, irreversible choices at every turn. Will you walk the path of revenge and power, or choose mercy, risking everything?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Explore gloomy backstreets, ancient ruins, and dangerous forests. From taverns buzzing with rumors to cursed towers\u2014every corner of the world breathes mystery and danger.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39Battle creatures and dangerous foes by dodging their attacks (or get clobbered). Solve cunning puzzles on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The only thing sharper than your blade is the truth you're afraid to face.&quot;\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 Black, a monster hunter.</p>","developers":["Nastalgist"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descripti